      "body_html": "<p dir=\"auto\">No active attempt. asterinas#3329 tried to fix it in June, but it was<br>\nclosed unmerged the same day (judged fully automated, not a technical rejection),<br>\nand upstream <code class=\"notranslate\">main</code> still has <code class=\"notranslate\">end_va = self.virt_addr() + len</code> unchecked, so #3159<br>\nremains open.</p>",
      "body_text": "No active attempt. asterinas#3329 tried to fix it in June, but it was\nclosed unmerged the same day (judged fully automated, not a technical rejection),\nand upstream main still has end_va = self.virt_addr() + len unchecked, so #3159\nremains open.",
